WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.792 --> 00:00:02.878
City workers found a body in a pipe.

00:00:05.172 --> 00:00:07.341
All right, here we go.
And, action.

00:00:09.009 --> 00:00:10.677
A young woman called Julia Madrigal.

00:00:12.304 --> 00:00:15.724
It was six years ago.
I was cut up like Julia.

00:00:15.807 --> 00:00:18.727
What someone did to Julia,
they tried to do to you.

00:00:19.311 --> 00:00:20.604
After what he did...

00:00:22.898 --> 00:00:24.316
everything changed.

00:00:28.362 --> 00:00:33.033
Kirby Mazrachi is six years
post a very traumatic incident

00:00:33.116 --> 00:00:35.786
where she was attacked,
and she survived.

00:00:36.620 --> 00:00:38.997
She's living with trauma,
and it's controlling her life.

00:00:40.123 --> 00:00:41.416
When we first meet Kirby,

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:42.918
we see her writing in her diary,

00:00:43.001 --> 00:00:45.462
and she's writing down
the most basic things.

00:00:45.546 --> 00:00:48.048
Her address,
what the name of her cat is,

00:00:48.131 --> 00:00:50.342
where she works,
what her desk looks like.

00:00:50.425 --> 00:00:53.095
-What's all this?
-I take notes, same as you.

00:00:53.178 --> 00:00:55.013
These are basic facts
that you already know.

00:00:55.430 --> 00:00:59.142
When I got out of the hospital,
everything was different.

00:00:59.268 --> 00:01:01.395
You don't really know
why this is happening.

00:01:05.482 --> 00:01:07.150
For me, the stuff
that really makes the show tick

00:01:07.234 --> 00:01:10.362
is the day-to-day trying
to keep control of your life

00:01:10.445 --> 00:01:11.989
that keeps falling out of control.

00:01:12.072 --> 00:01:13.740
I think a lot of people
can relate to that.

00:01:13.824 --> 00:01:17.160
She's trying to figure out
why her world keeps changing

00:01:17.244 --> 00:01:20.414
and how it's connected
to her attacker.

00:01:20.497 --> 00:01:21.373
In pursuing that,

00:01:21.456 --> 00:01:23.834
we also meet a journalist
investigating the story.

00:01:24.501 --> 00:01:26.211
A survivor hunting a serial killer,

00:01:26.295 --> 00:01:27.296
that's your story.

00:01:28.088 --> 00:01:31.133
Dan Velazquez is investigating
at the Chicago Sun-Times.

00:01:31.216 --> 00:01:34.386
Little by little,
they both track this killer.

00:01:34.469 --> 00:01:36.847
He moved around.
He kept his distance.

00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:39.766
He didn't, though. He got close.
He knew all about us.

00:01:40.058 --> 00:01:41.977
I'm already with you.

00:01:42.102 --> 00:01:43.645
I'm with all of you.

00:01:44.271 --> 00:01:50.068
The Shining Girls are the women
that he has chosen over the years to kill.

00:01:51.403 --> 00:01:53.906
They have potential.
They have a life ahead of them.

00:01:53.989 --> 00:01:56.867
They have this "I'm gonna go
make something of myself."

00:01:56.950 --> 00:01:58.952
And that is incredibly threatening.

00:02:00.120 --> 00:02:01.371
And that's what he has to take away.

00:02:03.957 --> 00:02:05.792
These women don't know each other.

00:02:05.876 --> 00:02:07.628
He is the one connecting them.

00:02:07.711 --> 00:02:12.549
These actors, Jamie, Wag, Pippa,
all turned in these performances

00:02:12.633 --> 00:02:15.594
that were super different
from anything they've ever done before.

00:02:15.677 --> 00:02:18.305
I love being involved in something

00:02:18.388 --> 00:02:21.725
that manages
to tell a very difficult story

00:02:21.808 --> 00:02:25.229
about trauma
and violence against women.

00:02:25.312 --> 00:02:28.065
There is this fantastical element to it,

00:02:28.148 --> 00:02:30.817
but there's also a lightness to it,
and there's a hope to it.

00:02:30.901 --> 00:02:33.487
The people who will like this show
are fans of great thrillers.

00:02:33.570 --> 00:02:35.989
They are fans who like
strong female characters,

00:02:36.156 --> 00:02:37.991
great drama and great performances.

00:02:38.075 --> 00:02:40.494
It's an entertainment show
with something to say.

00:02:40.577 --> 00:02:44.164
While I hope audiences
are carried away with the mystery,

00:02:44.248 --> 00:02:49.169
I hope they connect
with Kirby's story and her strength.

